Staged Alertmanager configuration "mimir-prod" (read-only until promoted; original names, before renames)

Routes (6):
MATCHERS                        RECEIVER            GROUP BY           CONTINUE  INTERVALS
(root)                          default-email       alertname,cluster  -         -
├─ env="prod", team="payments"  pagerduty-payments  (inherited)        false     mute: weekends
├─ severity=~"warning|info"     slack-alerts        alertname          true      -
│  └─ env="staging"             null                (inherited)        false     -
│     └─ instance=~".+"         default-email       (inherited)        false     -
└─ alertname="Watchdog"         null                (inherited)        false     active: business-hours

Receivers (4):
NAME                INTEGRATIONS
default-email       email
pagerduty-payments  pagerduty
slack-alerts        slack×2
null                none

Time intervals (2):
NAME            INTERVALS  SUMMARY
weekends        1          saturday,sunday
business-hours  1          monday:friday,09:00-17:00 (Europe/Berlin)

Inhibition rules (1):
#  SOURCE MATCHERS                                       TARGET MATCHERS     EQUAL
1  region="eu", severity="critical", service=~"api|web"  severity="warning"  alertname,cluster

Templates (2):
NAME        DEFINES                                   SIZE
email.tmpl  email.subject, email.body, email.with...  1.2 KB
slack.tmpl  slack.title                               312 B

Secrets are masked and global settings are dropped: use -o yaml to inspect the configuration, not to import it again.
